  "details": "If the receiver type is set to constant and multiple collision tags are added, it'd be neat to have an option to require all of the Collision tags to be present in the receiver before reporting true.\n\nThis would be easier than adding multiple contact receivers in the same place with different collision tags.\n\nEG: You want both left and right hand on a grip before activating it. A capsule sharped collider could go along the grip and wait for both \"Hand L\" and \"Hand R\" before reporting true.",
